{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"欢喜还在，他仍盼着对方也选自己，可对方并没有给出新的保证。\",\n      \"key\": \"也选自己\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他曾不再查看对方的反应、只管关心，安稳过一阵，可想被珍惜的心还是会回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"想被珍惜\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他试过把心思收住，仍想被珍惜，后来尽情喜欢也让他幸福，却不能保证对方会选他。\",\n      \"key\": \"会选他\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他不想让对方负责安抚他所有的不安，也不愿因怕落空就故意把喜欢压淡。\",\n      \"key\": \"把喜欢压淡\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍想让对方靠近自己，又不愿催对方回应，也不肯假装自己不在乎，心里很难受。\",\n      \"key\": \"假装自己不在乎\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"动摇\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R57\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把没有着落具体写成仍盼对方也选自己，并保留对方没有新保证的事实，让酸楚在欢喜还在时就有来由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R61\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\", \"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留克制带来安稳却压不住渴望的经历，也保留尽情投入带来的幸福；用两次真实经历说明，收住心思不能消除想被珍惜的愿望，尽情喜欢也不能保证对方会选他。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R60\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不把全部不安交给对方、也不因怕落空而削弱感情的两条边界，改成日常说法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R62\", \"R63\", \"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把想靠近、不催回应、难受且不肯假装不在乎收成同一冲突，保留他不愿否认任何一边的意思，删去谁都没有退让和不拿自欺换平静的总结口吻。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "95e2d4ae-c761-4d26-b392-f3c5479c3d59", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T112122601742Z", "elapsed_seconds": 652.516, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T11:32:15.135461+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c4148bc46e20a5647e8253e506efff0406b12e439a9a4ac6e365380c27b6cba7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_